OL,3,GNEWSAPreparatory work starts on #45m
OL,4,Abypass
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreparatory work on the first phase of
OL,7,Fa #45m bypass has begun, which a
OL,8,Fcouncil says could ultimately help to
OL,9,Fcreate 14,000 new homes.
OL,11,FThe first phase of the Hereford Bypass
OL,12,Fis to provide a new link between the
OL,13,FA49 and the A465, and is designed to
OL,14,Fimprove access from the south west of
OL,15,FHerefordshire and South Wales.
OL,17,FHerefordshire Council said the scheme
OL,18,Fwould help reduce traffic on Belmont
OL,19,FRoad, Walnut Tree Avenue, Holme Lacy
OL,20,FRoad and nearby rural routes currently
OL,21,Fused as shortcuts.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
