OL,3,GNEWSAPreparatory work starts on #45m
OL,4,Abypass
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Philip Price, cabinet member
OL,7,Ffor transport and infrastructure, said:
OL,8,F"Our priority is to ensure the scheme
OL,9,Fremains deliverable while providing
OL,10,Fvalue for money for Herefordshire
OL,11,Fresidents."
